  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building programme in support of the Palestinian National Authority ? Sanitary and Phyto-Sanitary (SPS) measures?PART I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: The Programme is meant to contribute to longer-term aspirations of improved enabling environment for the agriculture sector.

Specific objective: Improved effectiveness and efficiency of the MoA to deliver its services in relation to SPS. 

3.4 Programme results

A.	Established, prioritized and agreed upon National phytosanitary work plan. 
This result will address in particular problem statement 2 through activities A.1 and A.2. Problem statements 3 and 4 will be partially covered under activity A.3

B.	Strengthened capacity for developing and implementing a sustainable Strategic SPS-related Food Safety Plan. 
This result will address in particular problem statement 1, 3 and 4.</narrative>
  </description>
